# App data lives in the SharePoint "Documents" library and is read at runtime via
# the Graph API. It must never be committed to this PUBLIC repo or deployed to the
# public website. Keep it out of git entirely.
AppData/

# Working notes, not part of the deployed site.
HANDOFF.md

# Data files must never be committed or deployed. The apps read all data from
# SharePoint at runtime; nothing tabular belongs in this public repo. This also
# catches stray files dropped into the app folders during local testing.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
*.tsv
